{
  "title": "3D Short",
  "beats": [
    "In 1944, a Japanese soldier was sent to a tiny island",
    "in the Philippines with one order: never surrender.",
    "So he hid in the jungle and kept fighting.",
    "A year later, the war ended.",
    "Nobody told him.",
    "People dropped leaflets from planes saying the war was over.",
    "He decided they were fake.",
    "He lived on bananas and coconuts, patched his own uniform,",
    "and kept his rifle clean for decades.",
    "Search parties came looking for him.",
    "He hid from all of them.",
    "It took his old commander flying to the island",
    "in 1974 to finally give him the order to stop.",
    "He had been fighting a war that ended 29 years earlier.",
    "So the next time you think you're committed to something,",
    "just remember Hiroo Onoda never even checked his messages."
  ],
